
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.SensorRemove()`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llSensorRemove();`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Removes the sensor setup by <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlSensorRepeat" target="_blank">llSensorRepeat</a>.</p>
  <p>There are no parameters or return value for this function, as only one <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlSensorRepeat" target="_blank">llSensorRepeat</a> can be specified per script.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>sensor</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">30</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>If called within the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Sensor" target="_blank">sensor</a> event then it also removes all of the sensor data that is accessed by the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Detected" target="_blank">detection</a> functions.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
  <p>The following basic example shows an object that when touched starts scanning for avatars in 10m every 30 seconds, and stops as soon as at least one is found, and returns their name.</p>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll = llcompat

function LLEvents.touch_start(events)
    local x = #events
    ll.SensorRepeat("", NULL_KEY, AGENT, 10.0, PI, 30.0)
end

function LLEvents.sensor(events)
    local x = #events
    ll.Say(0, ll.DetectedName(0) .. " was found first!")
    ll.SensorRemove()
end
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`default {
    touch_start(integer x) {
        llSensorRepeat("", NULL_KEY, AGENT, 10.0, PI, 30.0);
    }
 
    sensor(integer x) {
        llSay(0, llDetectedName(0) + " was found first!");
        llSensorRemove();
    }
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
